{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11207180","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11207180","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1120718001:0":{"text":"흥, 사막의 발톱 놈들. 너희가 무슨 짓을 했는지 우리가 모를 줄 알아?!","source_cn":"哼，你们这群流沙之爪，以为大家不知道你们做过什么事吗？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x63F2073E16969F21","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1120718002:0":{"text":"마을 주변에서 약탈과 납치를 일삼으면서… 몇 명이나 해쳤는지 알기나 해?!","source_cn":"镇子周围的劫掠和绑架……你们害了多少人！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEE22695A1761421E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1120718003:0":{"text":"루마는 그런 적 없는데…!","source_cn":"卢玛没做过那些事……！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDDD7C389E87488FB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1120718004:0":{"text":"발뺌하지 마! 너희가 마을 주변에 온 뒤로부터 상단들의 발걸음도 끊겼다고!","source_cn":"少装无辜！自从你们开始劫掠，供货商队都不敢来！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x729DE9440EF76A53","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1120718005:0":{"text":"루, 루마는 그저 요리만 하는데… 나쁜 짓은 하지 않았어요!","source_cn":"卢玛一直在营地里煮汤，没——没做过坏事！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFA554E95627A9DBE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1120718006:0":{"text":"두목이 사라지자, 사막의 발톱도 뿔뿔이 흩어지고…\n루마는 그냥 입에 풀칠할 일거리나 찾으려는 건데… 제발 도와줘요…","source_cn":"头儿没了，流沙之爪也散了……\\n卢玛只是想找点活儿干，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x198AB95767752DBA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1120718007:0":{"text":"당장 안 꺼져? 너희 같은 놈들은 벌레 먹이로 사막에 내던져져야 해!","source_cn":"你走不走？像你们这种恶棍，就该丢到沙漠里暴晒，再喂给沙虫！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6C9B4E70E8D51FA0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1120718008:0":{"text":"뭘 그리 번거롭게! 마침 사막의 발톱에 현상금을 건 사람들이 많다던데, 잡아서 현상금이나 받자고!","source_cn":"用不着那么麻烦，有好些亲属被绑架的人悬赏流沙之爪的人头...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1F5DB5EB54CEEA00","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1120718009:0":{"text":"꼬마야, 천천히 뛰어. 총알이 빗나가면 꽤 고통스러운 인생의 마지막을 맞게 될 거야…","source_cn":"别跑得太快，小家伙。要是枪瞄不准，你的生命会结束得很痛苦……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3B46EBBB246A2D78","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1120718010:0":{"text":"아, 안 돼… 살려주세요!","source_cn":"不——不要！救命、救命啊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE852ED4FAA5EC1B0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1120718011:0":{"text":"제, 제발 루마 좀 사, 사, 살려주세요!","source_cn":"救救——救救卢玛！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7A4689CB399C228C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:17:1120718011":{"text":"제, 제발 루마 좀 사, 사, 살려주세요!","source_cn":"救救——救救卢玛！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7A4689CB399C228C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:17:0:1":{"text":"놓아주자","source_cn":"放过他吧","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x80F4E8F1AFF4463A","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"놓아주자","female":"놓아주자","variant_male_record_index":"64490","variant_female_record_index":"64491","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:17:1:2":{"text":"(조용히 상황을 지켜본다)","source_cn":"（静观其变）","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xEF6C80BA00F3AED9","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"(조용히 상황을 지켜본다)","female":"(조용히 상황을 지켜본다)","variant_male_record_index":"64492","variant_female_record_index":"64493","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:镇民艾科":{"text":"알렉시아","source":"镇民艾科","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:卢玛":{"text":"루마","source":"卢玛","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:商贩迈洛尔":{"text":"상인 마일로","source":"商贩迈洛尔","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:赏金猎人利斯克":{"text":"현상금 사냥꾼 리스키","source":"赏金猎人利斯克","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":15,"localized